usage: launch.py [-h] [--model-dir MODEL_DIR] [--timeline TIMELINE]
                 [--data-dir DATA_DIR] [--subject SUBJECT] [--host HOST]
                 [--port PORT] [--serial-port SERIAL_PORT] [--baud BAUD]
                 [{check,sender,receiver,car}]

Original v50 hardware/replay chain. Default check never opens devices.

positional arguments:
  {check,sender,receiver,car}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --model-dir MODEL_DIR
  --timeline TIMELINE   Cue timeline matching the actual recording/task
  --data-dir DATA_DIR   Original BCICIV2a GDF directory, sender only
  --subject SUBJECT
  --host HOST           Sender bind address or receiver server address
  --port PORT
  --serial-port SERIAL_PORT
                        Actual car port, for example COM3 or /dev/ttyUSB2
  --baud BAUD

